{# A CONTRIBUTED CELL ON THE ORGANIZATION DASHBOARD, written the way the
   contract documents one: rendered with `with_context: false`, everything in
   ONE map, this module's own figures under `by.patrols`. It reads nothing
   else, which is what makes it a test of the host rather than of itself.

   AND IT NAMES ITSELF. A person needs to know whose figure this is, so that
   the day the module is uninstalled its disappearance reads as the system
   working rather than as a bug. #}
<div class="c" data-w="patrols_org">
    <span class="tab">Out across the organization<span class="src">&middot; {{ by.patrols.out }} open</span></span>
    <span class="ao-by patrols"><i></i>patrols</span>
    <div class="use">{{ by.patrols.walked }} km walked today{{ by.patrols.organization ? ', everywhere' : '' }}.</div>
</div>
